      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-8 bg-accent/5 border border-accent/20 rounded-xl p-5 md:p-6">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-accent/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <p class="text-gray-900 font-semibold text-sm mb-1">Voice matching &amp;&nbsp;cost optimisation</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">We help match the right voice to your project - and we actively look for ways to keep costs down. For example: if a bilingual recording can be delivered by a single voice artist fluent in both languages, we won't propose two separate artists. Tell us what you need - we'll suggest the most cost-effective setup.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Trusted by -->
    <div class="bg-stone-100/80 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-8 md:p-12 mb-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Trusted by leading brands</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Since 2001, we have produced voiceover recordings for advertising agencies, media houses, corporations and film producers. Our clients include:</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 justify-center text-sm font-semibold text-gray-400">
        <span>TVN</span>
        <span>Orange</span>
        <span>Play</span>
        <span>PKO BP</span>
        <span>PZU</span>
        <span>Samsung</span>
        <span>Biedronka</span>
        <span>Allegro</span>
        <span>IKEA</span>
        <span>Leroy Merlin</span>
        <span>Media Markt</span>
        <span>RMF FM</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Presentation video -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">See our studio</h2>
      <div class="aspect-video bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative cursor-pointer border border-gray-200 shadow-md" data-vid="6gZmS_99rVs" onclick="loadYT(this)">
        <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/6gZmS_99rVs/sddefault.jpg" alt="Voiceover recordings - Powitania.pl studio" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/40 hover:bg-black/30 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-16 h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 text-white/90" viewBox="0 0 68 48"><path d="M66.52 7.74c-.78-2.93-2.49-5.41-5.42-6.19C55.79.13 34 0 34 0S12.21.13 6.9 1.55C3.97 2.33 2.27 4.81 1.48 7.74.06 13.05 0 24 0 24s.06 10.95 1.48 16.26c.78 2.93 2.49 5.41 5.42 6.19C12.21 47.87 34 48 34 48s21.79-.13 27.1-1.55c2.93-.78 4.64-3.26 5.42-6.19C67.94 34.95 68 24 68 24s-.06-10.95-1.48-16.26z" fill="red"/><path d="M45 24L27 14v20" fill="white"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">
            How much does a voiceover recording cost?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Voiceover recording prices start from EUR 70 net for short forms (local commercial, phone announcement). National campaigns - from EUR 210 net. The exact price depends on script length, chosen voice artist and licence type. <a href="/en/pricing/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">See full pricing →</a>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">
            How long does production take?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Standard turnaround is 2 business days from script and quote approval. Short commercial forms (up to 30 seconds) are often ready the same day. We also offer <a href="/en/express-recording/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">express recordings</a> delivered within hours.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">
            How do I order a voiceover recording?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            The easiest way is through the <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">voice bank</a>: go to the profile of the voice artist you like and use the order builder - for most services (local commercials, IVR, short forms) you can calculate the price and place the order yourself in a few steps. For non-standard projects (film narration, audiobooks, national campaigns) email <a href="mailto:biuro@powitania.pl" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">biuro@powitania.pl</a> for a custom quote. We deliver the finished audio file by email.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">
            Can I listen to samples before ordering?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Yes - every voice artist profile in our <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">voice bank</a> includes audio samples. On request, we also prepare a free custom sample with your script so you can hear the voice in the context of your project.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">
            What languages do you record in?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We produce recordings in over 30 languages, including: Polish, English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Russian, Ukrainian, Czech, Dutch, Arabic and many more. We work with <a href="/en/voice-bank/?native=1" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">native speakers</a> to ensure authentic sound.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">
            What types of voiceover recordings do you offer?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We offer: advertising spots (radio, TV, online), film narration (promotional, instructional, documentary), phone announcements (IVR), audiobooks, e-learning recordings, multimedia presentations, podcasts, audio guides and dubbing. If your project requires something non-standard - <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">get in touch</a>.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">
            Do you offer express recordings?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Yes. Short forms (spots up to 30 seconds, IVR messages) can be delivered within hours. <a href="/en/express-recording/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">Express recording</a> is an additional option available on business days.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">
            Do you offer remote sessions (live direction)?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Yes - we offer <a href="/en/remote-sessions/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">remote sessions</a> via Google Meet or Zoom. Direct the recording in real time from anywhere in the world, provide feedback on the spot.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">
            What audio file formats do you deliver?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We deliver WAV (48 kHz / 24-bit) and MP3 (320 kbps) as standard. AIFF, FLAC or other formats available on request. Audio-video editing (embedding the voiceover into your video) is available as an additional service.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">
            Do you help with script preparation?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Yes. Use our <a href="/en/#kreator" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">script creator</a>, which guides you step by step. We also help with editing and adapting scripts for audio delivery - so the recording sounds natural.
          </div>
        </details>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <div class="text-center p-8 md:p-12 bg-stone-100/80 rounded-2xl border border-accent/20">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Need a voiceover recording?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 max-w-xl mx-auto">Prepare your script, choose a voice artist and place your order. Free quote, delivery within 2 business days.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
        <a href="/en/#kreator" class="bg-accent hover:bg-accent-light text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold transition-colors">Prepare your script</a>
        <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="bg-white hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold transition-colors border border-gray-300">Choose a voice</a>
        <a href="/en/express-recording/" class="bg-white hover:bg-gray-100 text-yellow-600 px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold transition-colors border border-yellow-400/20">Express recording</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

